			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://writing.exchange/@ernie\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>ernie</span></a></span> Yeah: Google is basically hundreds of different companies—most of Google’s performance advice can be viewed as though it is aimed directly at other teams at Google. I think in many cases the web performance resources were prepared with that in mind.</p><p>Notably, the solution I recommend is a web component written by a Google employee 😅</p>",
